&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Inactive Ingredients:&lt;/b&gt; Acacia Senegal Gum, Chlorphenesin, Citric Acid, Ethylhexylglycerin, Glycerin, Kaolin, Levocarnitine, Niacinamide, Phenoxyethanol, Poly-L-Lysine (30000-70000 MW), Propanediol, Silica Silylate, Sodium Citrate, Water.&lt;/p&gt;
